  "description": "A sparkling clean kitchen is a point of pride for any restaurant owner in Illinois. But what about the clean you can't see? Lurking above your cooking appliances, hidden within the ductwork, lies a threat that can impact your restaurant's safety, efficiency, and bottom line. We're talking about your kitchen exhaust system, and keeping it clean goes far beyond surface-level shine. In this guide, we'll delve into how professional kitchen exhaust cleaning is a critical investment in protecting your Illinois restaurant.",
